      <data key="d4">This UFR will accelerate the application of AI to challenging proliferation detection scenarios, including through deployment and maturation of DNN R&amp;D's Alexandria Data Management System; the development, prototyping, and demonstration of AI-driven process modeling; and the development AI-enabled system-of-systems digital twin developments and fully leverage the Digital Transformation effort in NA-10/IM.</data>
