    <node id="scope_description:the_ufr_is_a_joint_effort_between_na_im_and_na_1:63a00aad8c">
      <data key="d4">The UFR is a joint effort between NA-IM and NA-11 with benefits for NA-10, -20,-20, and -IM. The effort will support a new HPC resource concept that enables the efficient use of resources to support NNSA's growing mission demand. Full details of the effort are found in the NA-114 whitepaper.</data>
