      <data key="d14">24</data>
      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is simply “f-Electron Materials Project,” which directly emphasizes materials science rather than facility operations or nonproliferation monitoring. Supporting context places this under Physics &amp; Engineering Models within Advanced Simulation and Computing, consistent with materials modeling and development workflows. Among the options, this aligns best with the challenge focused on accelerating materials discovery, production, and qualification for strategic deterrence, even though the evidence is brief, so confidence is medium rather than high.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">19025000.0</data>
