      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on synthesizing and characterizing target alloys and using machine learning to discover new alloys, which is directly about AI-enabled materials discovery and development. This aligns closely with the materials lifecycle and AI-accelerated discovery described in the “Accelerating Materials Discovery, Production, and Qualification for Strategic Deterrence” challenge. The WBS and STAT context of Advanced Manufacturing Development further supports a materials/manufacturing focus rather than enterprise business processes or DA/PA design–production integration at the system level.</data>
