      <data key="d17">The scope description only states that the funding supports participation in Genesis Mission Technology and Science Challenges that apply AI to accelerating mission problems, increasing enterprise efficiency, or increasing scientific/engineering insight, without specifying acquisition, production/safety, or experimental facilities. All three candidate challenges fit parts of this generic description, so there is no direct textual signal for any single one. Given the need to choose exactly one, Accelerating Nuclear Enterprise Acquisition is selected as a plausible representative of “accelerating mission problems” and “increasing enterprise efficiency,” but the evidence is weak and non-specific, so confidence is low. SME correction: Corrected</data>
