      <data key="d17">The scope description is broad: participation in Genesis Platforms that apply AI to accelerating mission problems, increasing enterprise efficiency, or increasing scientific/engineering insight. With no explicit emphasis on acquisition or experimental facilities, the most directly aligned challenge is the business and management–focused one, which targets enterprise efficiency and integrated AI platforms supporting national security missions. The WBS (AI for Nuclear Security under Advanced Simulation and Computing) supports a general AI platform use rather than specifically acquisition or experimental facility operations, reinforcing this mapping but with only medium confidence due to the generic wording. SME correction: Corrected</data>
