      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on “Few View Radiography; application of ML techniques to problems in the analysis and interpretation of weapon physics data.” This is directly aligned with physics-informed AI for interpreting limited radiographic data in a weapons/assessment context, which matches the nuclear threat assessment and response challenge that emphasizes integrating sensor data, simulations, and physics-based models for decision support. It is not about digitizing historical archives or enterprise business processes, so the other two challenges are less applicable.</data>
