      <data key="d14">4</data>
      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on productionizing AI tools that accelerate weapons design, modeling, and simulation workflows (CHANDLER federated model, Horizon Shield simulation workflow, CADSAT meshing tool) and deploying supporting infrastructure and secure AI on classified networks. This aligns best with the challenge centered on AI-driven data and simulation readiness, including meshing and making data simulation-ready, which is explicitly called out in the Historic Nuclear Data and Research challenge’s proposed solution. While there is some overlap with design/production integration and experimental facilities, the emphasis here is on AI tools and infrastructure for modeling/simulation and secure data use, not on DA/PA co-optimization or facility operations, so the data/simulation-focused challenge is the closest fit. SME correction: Corrected</data>
