      <data key="d14">6</data>
      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description explicitly focuses on “New materials discovery for HE/Light sources -- New AI/ML,” which directly aligns with AI-enabled materials discovery and development. The associated WBS and STAT context (Dynamic Materials Properties under Assessment Science for stockpile research) further indicate work on mission-critical material properties for the deterrent. This maps cleanly to the challenge centered on accelerating materials discovery, production, and qualification, rather than to proliferation monitoring or emergency response.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">110903334.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
    </edge>
