      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on creating a structured library of high explosive (HE) characterizations and microstructural data so that AI/ML can be applied, emphasizing that AI/ML cannot be used without supporting data in correct formats. This aligns best with the challenge centered on digitizing, organizing, and standardizing nuclear-related data to make it usable for AI-driven research and decision-making. While the content is materials-focused rather than historical test archives, the core objective—building well-formatted, searchable datasets to enable AI—matches the data-centric nature of “Harnessing America’s Historic Nuclear Data and Research” more closely than the operational threat response or forensic attribution challenges. SME correction: Corrected</data>
