      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on using ML to develop synthesis pathways to novel high‑performance materials, synthesizing candidate materials, and characterizing their sensitivity and performance. This is directly about accelerating discovery and development of new energetic materials (explosives) to expand design options, which aligns with the materials lifecycle and qualification focus of the “Accelerating Materials Discovery, Production, and Qualification for Strategic Deterrence” challenge. The other challenges emphasize design–production integration or nonproliferation monitoring rather than materials synthesis and characterization.</data>
