      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description emphasizes NA-11, nuclear deterrence, and development of AI capabilities supported by ASC’s AI4NS sub-program, which is tightly coupled to weapons design, stockpile research, and engineering. The STAT/WBS context (Stockpile Research, Technology, and Engineering → Assessment Science → Dynamic Materials Properties) aligns with weapons physics and design/production activities rather than business management or acquisition. Among the Genesis challenges, this best matches the mission focus of integrating AI into nuclear weapons design and production operations for deterrence, rather than enterprise business processes or acquisition workflows.</data>
