      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on AI/ML workflows and frontier-class AI models that use expanded underground test (UGT) diagnostic data and experimental datasets to reveal causal relationships in material response. This is fundamentally about exploiting and learning from rich historical and experimental nuclear data, aligning best with the challenge centered on digitizing, structuring, and leveraging America’s historic nuclear data and research. The other options emphasize real-time threat response or facility operations, which are not indicated in the scope description. Confidence is medium because the text does not explicitly mention digitization, but it clearly emphasizes AI models built on extensive nuclear test and experimental data. SME correction: Corrected</data>
