      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description ties this funding to NA-11’s AI Genesis Mission work on “Developing Artificial Intelligence Tools for Nuclear Deterrence” and cites ASC’s AI4NS sub-program as informing scope and cost. That framing emphasizes AI in direct support of nuclear deterrence mission and weapons-related science and engineering, which best aligns with the design/production-focused nuclear deterrence challenge rather than business-process or acquisition-centric challenges. However, the description is high-level and does not explicitly mention DA/PA integration or production operations, so confidence is medium rather than high.</data>
      <data key="d18">UFR</data>
      <data key="d19">56442000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
