      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on AI/ML to automatically index, catalog, extract metadata, and search across an increased number of digital repositories. This aligns directly with the historic data challenge, which centers on AI-driven digitization, metadata/ontology creation, and searchability of nuclear records. The WBS name “Archiving &amp; Support” and STAT context reinforce that this is about data archiving and access, not materials development or production process optimization, making the historic nuclear data and research challenge the best fit.</data>
