      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description emphasizes workforce reductions and that A&amp;S activities are heavily concentrated in personnel and AI/ML tools, with critical AI/ML endeavors remaining a strategic priority across laboratories, plants, and sites. This points to AI supporting cross-cutting administrative and support (A&amp;S) functions rather than materials R&amp;D or facility safety-basis automation. Among the options, this aligns best with improving and sustaining AI-enabled business and management processes that underpin national security missions, even though the entry is a decrement rather than a new investment.</data>
      <data key="d18">DECREMENT</data>
      <data key="d19">-10365000.0</data>
