      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on expanding deployment of a tool suite across design agencies to perform data conditioning, curation, and labeling for legacy weapons data. This directly aligns with the challenge centered on digitizing, organizing, and making historic nuclear and weapons data usable for research and decision-making. The emphasis on legacy data and archiving/support matches the data-preservation and digitization mission, not design–production integration or materials discovery.</data>
      <data key="d18">UFR</data>
      <data key="d19">153848000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
    </edge>
