    <edge source="programming_record:programming_data_csv:24" target="mstc_challenge:increasing_experimental_capacity_at_nuclear_rese:e9a4a1153b" id="classified_as_challenge:programming_record_programming_data_csv_24">
      <data key="d11">classified_as_challenge</data>
      <data key="d12">1</data>
      <data key="d13">classification_pipeline</data>
      <data key="d14">24</data>
      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on “Capability Development, ICF Operations, Develop experimental capabilities and support for target metrology in Fusion Yield Platforms,” which is directly about enhancing experimental capabilities and operations at an ICF facility. The associated STAT and WBS lines are for Inertial Confinement Fusion Facility Operations, reinforcing that this funding is to improve experimental throughput and capability at a high-consequence nuclear research facility, aligning best with the challenge on Increasing Experimental Capacity at Nuclear Research Facilities rather than enterprise-wide design/production integration or regulatory streamlining.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">19451000.0</data>
