      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description, “Constraining Mix using radiochemistry on NIF,” and the WBS/STAT context (ICF Diagnostics &amp; Instrumentation under Inertial Confinement Fusion) indicate work focused on nuclear experiments and diagnostics at the National Ignition Facility, a limited-capacity, high-consequence experimental facility. This aligns with the challenge centered on increasing experimental capacity and optimizing experiments at nuclear research facilities, rather than digitizing historical records or real-time threat response. The match is based on experimental design/diagnostics at NIF, so confidence is medium given the brief description.</data>
