    <edge source="programming_record:programming_data_csv:30" target="mstc_challenge:accelerating_materials_discovery_production_and:e89fa227cf" id="classified_as_challenge:programming_record_programming_data_csv_30">
      <data key="d11">classified_as_challenge</data>
      <data key="d12">1</data>
      <data key="d13">classification_pipeline</data>
      <data key="d14">30</data>
      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description focuses on applying AI/ML techniques for qualification of CT data for part acceptance, which is directly about using AI to improve and streamline material/part qualification processes. This aligns with the Accelerating Materials Discovery, Production, and Qualification challenge, whose core aim is an AI-accelerated workflow for material/part qualification and reduced testing burden. The WBS and STAT context (Advanced Certification &amp; Qualification) further supports that this effort is about certification/qualification of components rather than enterprise-wide design–production integration or historical data digitization.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">1750000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
    </edge>
