      <data key="d17">The scope description is extremely terse: “Critical Executable CE UFR: Genesis AI,” giving no direct indication of experiments, regulatory/safety documentation, or DA/PA integration. Supporting context shows this is a Multi-Weapon Systems (formerly MTP) effort under Stockpile Operations, labeled as a mission-critical executable for the AI Genesis Mission and digital transformation. Among the three options, the one most tightly tied to multi-weapon systems and enterprise-wide, mission-critical AI infrastructure for deterrence is the design–production integration challenge, which focuses on a nuclear security enterprise twin and model-based systems engineering across the weapons enterprise. Because the evidence is indirect and largely inferential, confidence is low.</data>
