      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on implementing activities under EO 14299 and expanding IAEA safeguards at U.S. nuclear facilities, which is directly tied to international safeguards, nonproliferation, and monitoring of nuclear materials. The WBS and STAT lines are in Nonproliferation and Arms Control / Civil Nuclear Cooperation &amp; Engagement, and the funding office is NA-20, all of which align with strengthening safeguards and detecting/protecting against proliferation threats rather than acquisition reform or experimental facility throughput.</data>
