    <edge source="programming_record:programming_data_csv:51" target="mstc_challenge:accelerating_business_and_management_processes_f:1739dbeef6" id="classified_as_challenge:programming_record_programming_data_csv_51">
      <data key="d11">classified_as_challenge</data>
      <data key="d12">1</data>
      <data key="d13">classification_pipeline</data>
      <data key="d14">51</data>
      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description, “Telecommunication &amp; AI Infrastructure Program Integration,” and the interest area “AI GENESIS PLATFORM” indicate an effort to build and maintain shared AI and IT infrastructure/platform capabilities rather than specific nuclear experimental facilities or materials R&amp;D. This aligns best with the business/management challenge, which emphasizes a unified platform and AI tools to integrate and accelerate enterprise workflows and data, matching the idea of an AI infrastructure platform supporting broader mission operations. The facilities and materials-focused challenges are less consistent with the generic platform and operations-of-facilities context provided.</data>
      <data key="d18">UFR</data>
      <data key="d19">15220000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA90</data>
    </edge>
