      <data key="d15">low</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description only indicates an electrical power capacity upgrade at LANL, which most directly supports physical infrastructure and potentially experimental facility capacity. Among the options, this aligns best with Increasing Experimental Capacity at Nuclear Research Facilities, as added electrical capacity is a prerequisite for higher experimental throughput. However, the evidence does not explicitly reference experiments, facilities, or acquisition/business processes, so the mapping is uncertain.</data>
