      <data key="d15">low</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description focuses on AI Data Center activities tied to a Site-Wide Environmental Impact Statement/NEPA, which aligns more with enterprise infrastructure, operations, and compliance than with weapons design/production integration or digitization of historic nuclear test data. Among the options, this most plausibly supports the broader AI business/management ecosystem and data platform needed for national security missions, though the mapping is weak because the description is very general and infrastructure-oriented. SME correction: Corrected</data>
