      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on maintaining a decision and analytics platform and developing new data analysis, operational, and AI tools. This aligns best with the challenge centered on real-time decision support for nuclear threat assessment and response, which emphasizes integrating diverse data and AI for operational decision-making. While safety and regulatory efficiency are relevant, the emphasis on a decision platform and analytics for operations more closely matches the threat assessment and response challenge than the archival/data-digitization or regulatory streamlining challenges. SME correction: Corrected</data>
