      <data key="d17">The scope describes funding employee access to core Microsoft and DOE services and tools to enable widespread innovation in day-to-day operations across the enterprise. This is generic IT enablement rather than design/production integration or safety/regulatory streamlining. Among the three options, it most closely aligns with enterprise-wide efficiency and operational improvement in support of acquisition and business processes, which fits best under Accelerating Nuclear Enterprise Acquisition, though the mapping is indirect and thus confidence is low.</data>
