    <edge source="programming_record:programming_data_csv:59" target="mstc_challenge:accelerating_business_and_management_processes_f:1739dbeef6" id="classified_as_challenge:programming_record_programming_data_csv_59">
      <data key="d11">classified_as_challenge</data>
      <data key="d12">1</data>
      <data key="d13">classification_pipeline</data>
      <data key="d14">59</data>
      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is broad—funding AI investments in general—but the program interest area is explicitly the AI GENESIS PLATFORM, which aligns most closely with the business and management–oriented Genesis platform described in the “Accelerating Business and Management Processes for National Security Missions” challenge. The STAT codes (Information Technology &amp; Cybersecurity) and WBS name (Artificial Intelligence – Program Work) suggest enterprise IT/AI enablement rather than nuclear data digitization or acquisition-specific tooling, making the business and management platform challenge the best fit.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">15148200.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NAIM</data>
    </edge>
