      <data key="d15">low</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope describes a mixed-classification high-performance computing resource to efficiently support NNSA’s growing mission demand, under an AI Genesis Platform interest area. It is a general-purpose, cross-mission HPC capability rather than clearly tied to business/management workflows or to design–production integration for deterrence. Among the three options, it most plausibly underpins mission operations such as nuclear threat assessment and response that require mixed-classification HPC and AI, but the description is generic, so confidence is low. SME correction: Corrected</data>
