      <data key="d15">low</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is very general: “Multi-Weapon Systems AI and Digital Transformation IA,” with STAT pointing to Stockpile Management and Multi-Weapon Systems. All three candidate challenges involve AI, digital transformation, and operations. Given the multi-weapon systems focus and lack of explicit reference to regulatory/safety documentation or experimental facilities, the most plausible alignment is with integrating design and production across the enterprise rather than purely facility experimental capacity or regulatory streamlining. However, the evidence is sparse and non-specific, so confidence is low.</data>
