      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on Bayesian Model Calibration with ML surrogate models and includes JASPER work, which is closely tied to dynamic materials properties and high-pressure material behavior. The STAT and WBS context (“Assessment Science” and “Dynamic Materials Properties”) indicate this effort supports understanding and qualifying material response under extreme conditions, aligning best with accelerating materials discovery, production, and qualification. While AI and modeling are also relevant to design/production integration, the explicit materials-properties focus makes the materials challenge the closest fit.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">5650000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
