      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is simply “High Z Materials,” and the WBS/STAT context is “Dynamic Materials Properties” under Stockpile Research, Technology, and Engineering. High‑Z material behavior and dynamic properties are core to materials R&amp;D and qualification for the stockpile, aligning most directly with the materials discovery and qualification challenge. There is no indication of nonproliferation monitoring or historical data digitization, so the materials-focused Genesis challenge is the best fit, though the sparse description limits confidence to medium.</data>
