      <data key="d15">low</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description, “Inverse design of AM lattices,” points to AI-enabled design and optimization of additively manufactured lattice structures. This is most closely related to integrating design and production workflows—using AI to co-optimize designs and manufacturability—rather than digitizing historical data or operating experimental facilities. The WBS under Dynamic Materials Properties and the AI program work context support a design/engineering focus, but the brief description provides limited detail, so confidence is low.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">1200000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
    </edge>
