      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is “New materials discovery for HE,” directly aligning with the Accelerating Materials Discovery challenge, which focuses on AI-accelerated discovery, development, and qualification of mission-critical materials. The WBS and STAT context (Dynamic Materials Properties under Stockpile Research, Technology, and Engineering) further supports that this is about materials R&amp;D for the stockpile, not nonproliferation monitoring or historical data digitization.</data>
