      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on applying machine learning to small-scale experimental weapons data and integral experiments, specifically for analysis and interpretation of weapon physics data. This directly aligns with improving experimental design, analysis, and throughput at limited-capacity nuclear facilities, which is the core of “Increasing Experimental Capacity at Nuclear Research Facilities,” rather than digitizing historical archives or business/management workflows.</data>
