      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on machine learning analysis for multi-modal radiography and interpretation of weapon physics data, which aligns with advanced data analysis and physics-informed modeling to support assessment and response in nuclear contexts. While it is experimental in nature, the emphasis is on analyzing complex sensor/diagnostic data for weapon physics, fitting best with the threat assessment, preparedness, and response challenge rather than archival data digitization or facility throughput optimization.</data>
