      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on developing a modular, data‑driven ML approach for automatic calibration of Scorpius using discrepancy learning, explicitly tied to NIF implosion design, control, and certification methodologies. This is tightly aligned with AI-enabled modeling, calibration, and certification workflows for nuclear weapons design and production, which is central to the “Integrating Design and Production Operations for Nuclear Deterrence” challenge. It is less about business/management processes or digitizing historical archives, so the other two challenges fit poorly by comparison.</data>
