      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope describes developing a modeling tool and digital twin for the Scorpius accelerator, integrated into the EPICS control system, combining multiple physics models (ITS data, PushML for accelerator gaps, beam transport codes, target dynamics, and radiography modeling). This is directly aligned with creating AI-enabled facility digital twins and integrated experimental control/analysis systems to optimize high-consequence experiments and increase experimental capacity, matching the “Increasing Experimental Capacity at Nuclear Research Facilities” challenge rather than archival data digitization or business-process platforms.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">3000000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
    </edge>
