      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is simply “ML tools using Bayesian analysis and simulation,” which aligns most directly with AI-driven experimental design, uncertainty quantification, and simulation-heavy workflows. The supporting STAT/WBS context (Stockpile Research, Technology, and Engineering → Assessment Science → Primary Assessment Technologies) indicates stockpile-focused experimental and assessment work rather than emergency response operations or archival digitization. Among the options, this best matches the experimental optimization and simulation-centric focus of “Increasing Experimental Capacity at Nuclear Research Facilities.”</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">1100000.0</data>
