      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on nuclear reactions on unstable isotopes and surrogate reactions at TAMU, which are experimental nuclear physics activities. Among the options, this aligns most closely with increasing experimental capacity at nuclear research facilities, as it involves designing and conducting specialized experiments, even though the description does not explicitly mention facilities, data digitization, or design–production integration. The match is indirect, so confidence is low.</data>
