      <data key="d13">classification_pipeline</data>
      <data key="d14">19</data>
      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on AI/ML tools to predict compatibility/incompatibility of energetic materials and automated analysis of spectroscopic data (MS, FTIR), using a multimodal surveillance and aging framework to build data-driven predictive capabilities. This is directly aligned with AI-accelerated materials behavior prediction and lifecycle understanding, which fits the materials discovery/production/qualification challenge. It does not address nonproliferation monitoring or digitization of historical records, making the materials-focused challenge the best match.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
      <data key="d19">47405647.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
