      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope focuses on deployment of small-scale AI training hardware and development/optimization of AI software stacks within the Advanced Simulation and Computing / Computational Systems &amp; Software Environment WBS. This aligns most directly with AI and computing infrastructure that underpins design and production modeling for the stockpile, fitting the design–production integration and model-based engineering emphasis of “Integrating Design and Production Operations for Nuclear Deterrence,” rather than business-process platforms or experimental facility operations.</data>
