      <data key="d15">low</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is extremely sparse (“MADA Tri-lab project”), so the mapping relies on supporting context. The STAT and WBS point to Advanced Simulation and Computing / Integrated Codes under Stockpile Research, which aligns most directly with AI-enabled experimental design, simulation, and facility digital twins described in the “Increasing Experimental Capacity at Nuclear Research Facilities” challenge. The other two challenges focus more on production, regulatory processes, and DA/PA integration rather than core simulation and experimental throughput. Due to minimal scope detail, confidence is low.</data>
