      <data key="d17">The scope description focuses on AI workflows for weapon component engineering authorization analysis, which aligns with integrating design and production decision processes for nuclear deterrence. The WBS and STAT context (Physics &amp; Engineering Models under Advanced Simulation and Computing) and the emphasis on engineering authorization suggest model-based, AI-enabled design/production integration rather than facility operations or historical data digitization, matching the Integrating Design and Production Operations for Nuclear Deterrence challenge.</data>
      <data key="d18">BASELINE</data>
