      <data key="d15">low</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope describes an AI initiative to launch 3–4 academic centers focused broadly on AI studies and applications (AI Academic Strategic Alliance). This is generic AI program work without clear emphasis on nuclear design/production integration or digitization of historical nuclear data. Among the three options, it most closely aligns with building general AI capabilities and workforce/enterprise use of AI to improve processes, which fits best under Accelerating Business and Management Processes for National Security Missions, but the mapping is weak because the description lacks explicit business/management or PPBE language.</data>
