      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is “Production Simulation and Digital Twins,” and the process improvement area is DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION with AI PROGRAM WORK under STOCKPILE PRODUCTION SCIENCE. Among the options, the Integrating Design and Production Operations challenge explicitly emphasizes an AI-powered “nuclear security enterprise twin,” production digital twins, and co-optimization of design and manufacturing, which aligns closely with production-focused simulation and digital twin activities. The other challenges focus more on regulatory/safety process streamlining or materials discovery and qualification rather than enterprise-level production digital twins and design–production integration.</data>
