      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is "Production Simulation and Digital Twins" with context of DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION, AI PROGRAM WORK, and a WBS under Advanced Certification &amp; Qualification. This aligns most directly with the challenge focused on an AI-powered "nuclear security enterprise twin" and integrating design and production via digital twins and production simulations to improve certification and production efficiency. While materials and regulatory/safety themes are less evident, the emphasis on production digital twins and advanced certification best matches the Integrating Design and Production Operations challenge.</data>
      <data key="d18">ROT</data>
      <data key="d19">12500000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
    </edge>
