      <data key="d17">The scope description and program request only state "Developing Artificial Intelligence Tools for Nuclear Deterrence" with no further detail. All three candidate challenges involve AI and nuclear deterrence. With no explicit cues about nuclear forensics/attribution or emergency response, the effort most plausibly aligns with modernizing and supporting the deterrent itself, which is closest in spirit to the design/production-focused challenge. However, because the description is extremely generic and could fit any of the three, confidence is low.</data>
