    <edge source="programming_record:programming_data_fynsp27_wide_csv:45" target="mstc_challenge:integrating_design_and_production_operations_for:a1b61701e5" id="classified_as_challenge:programming_record_programming_data_fynsp27_wide_csv_45">
      <data key="d11">classified_as_challenge</data>
      <data key="d12">1</data>
      <data key="d13">classification_pipeline</data>
      <data key="d14">45</data>
      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope emphasizes AI investments to accelerate design cycles, improve analysis of complex data sets, and reduce costs across Defense Programs, which aligns most directly with integrating and modernizing design and production workflows for nuclear deterrence. The STAT/WBS context (Advanced Simulation and Computing; Computational Systems &amp; Software Environment) and the program request to develop AI tools for nuclear deterrence further support a focus on AI-enabled design and production integration rather than archival data digitization or regulatory/safety process streamlining.</data>
      <data key="d18">ROT</data>
      <data key="d19">12756000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
    </edge>
