      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description emphasizes AI investments to accelerate design cycles, improve analysis of complex data, and reduce costs across Defense Programs, which aligns most directly with integrating and modernizing design and production for nuclear deterrence. The program request explicitly focuses on developing AI tools for nuclear deterrence, matching the deterrence-focused, design/production-integration nature of the first challenge more than the archival/data-digitization focus of the second or the regulatory/safety-process focus of the third. However, the description is broad and could also support enterprise-wide efficiency, so confidence is medium rather than high.</data>
      <data key="d18">ROT</data>
      <data key="d19">506751000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
    </edge>
