      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">False</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description emphasizes AI investments to accelerate design cycles, improve analysis of complex data sets, and reduce costs across Defense Programs, directly tied to nuclear deterrence. This aligns best with the design–production integration challenge, which focuses on AI-accelerated, model-based systems engineering, digital twins, and improved efficiency for weapons modernization. The WBS (Physics &amp; Engineering Models) and STAT context under Advanced Simulation and Computing further support a focus on design and production modeling rather than archival data or experimental facility throughput, making the integration challenge the closest fit.</data>
      <data key="d18">ROT</data>
      <data key="d19">45105000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
    </edge>
