      <data key="d14">54</data>
      <data key="d15">high</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope description is “Production Simulation and Digital Twins,” and the program is in Stockpile Production Science with a digital transformation and AI program work focus. The first challenge explicitly centers on an AI-powered “nuclear security enterprise twin,” production digital twins, and integrating design and production to improve manufacturing efficiency—directly matching the emphasis on production-focused simulation and digital twins. The other challenges focus more on materials lifecycle or regulatory/safety process streamlining rather than enterprise-wide production twins and DA/PA integration.</data>
      <data key="d18">ROT</data>
      <data key="d19">100900000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA11</data>
    </edge>
