      <data key="d17">The scope description is only listed as “Validated,” providing no direct detail. Supporting context shows this is AI program work under Digital Transformation for Multi-Weapon Systems within Stockpile Management/Stockpile Operations, which most closely aligns with integrating design and production activities for weapons systems rather than facility experiment throughput or enterprise-wide acquisition. Because the primary evidence is effectively absent, the mapping relies on indirect cues from WBS and process area, so confidence is low.</data>
