      <data key="d15">medium</data>
      <data key="d16">True</data>
      <data key="d17">The scope describes an enterprise AI tool to inform NNSA infrastructure decision making and help NNSA “Build SMART with confidence” within Maintenance and Repair of Facilities. This aligns more with streamlining facility and infrastructure planning, documentation, and regulatory/safety-related decision processes than with pure acquisition workflows or materials R&amp;D. Among the options, the challenge focused on streamlining production and regulatory/safety processes in high-hazard facilities best matches an AI decision-support tool for infrastructure and operations, even though the description is more about planning than explicit safety-basis automation, so confidence is medium.</data>
      <data key="d18">UFR</data>
      <data key="d19">32950000.0</data>
      <data key="d20">NA90</data>
